## Architecture

The planned image processing pipeline is:

Smartphone Image
→ Image Validation
→ ROI Extraction
→ Skin Segmentation
→ Color Correction
→ Feature Extraction
→ EfficientNet
→ Classification and Regression
→ Explainability
→ FastAPI
→ React Frontend

See docs/architecture.md when implementation documentation
becomes available.

