## Medical Disclaimer

This project is intended for research and educational purposes.

It is not a clinically validated medical device.

Its predictions must not be used independently for diagnosis,
treatment decisions, phototherapy decisions, or neonatal discharge.

Clinical evaluation and appropriate regulatory requirements
must be addressed before any real-world medical use.

## Development Principles

- Modular architecture
